        },
        "collocations": [],
        "examples": {
          "standard": [
            {
              "text": "「早いとこ済ませないと、また雨が降ってくるぞ！」",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-2.5-flash-lite"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "この仕事は、早いとこ片付けて、明日の準備をしよう。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-2.5-flash-lite"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "「早いとこ連絡してくれよ、心配なんだ！」",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-2.5-flash-lite"
              }
            }
          ],
